<title>USA: U.S. Trust names Rahe vice chairman.</title>
<headline>U.S. Trust names Rahe vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Trust Corp said Wednesday Maribeth Rahe was named vice chairman, a newly created position.</p>
<p>Rahe, currently vice chairman at Chicago-based Harris Bank, a Bank of Montreal affiliate, will become a member of the company's four-person Office of the Chairman, U.S. Trust said in press release.</p>
<p>Rahe will join the company in July.</p>
</text>
